          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੰਗਣਾ (maṅgṇā) is inherited from Sanskrit mārgati, \"seeks, requests\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi maṅgṇā, \"to ask for\", under it (CDIAL 10074)."
